      "id": "claim_8b20e11fbd844185aa811f56f7761b53",
      "statement": "A third, separate workflow (.github/workflows/wiki-publish.yml, 'Publish Wiki') renders the committed openwiki/ markdown into the repository's separate GitHub Wiki tab (<repo>.wiki.git) via the dependency-free scripts/publish-wiki.mjs, triggered on push to main touching openwiki/**, scripts/publish-wiki.mjs, or the workflow file itself, plus manual workflow_dispatch.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://.github/workflows/wiki-publish.yml",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:417ac9fe2ec4224a0c3c0b99506d59250aa7c39cfecdf8585b2510c94d573eab"
        }
